{"seq":2,"slug":"adc-sampling","title":"ADC 与采样","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/sensors-actuators/interface/adc-sampling","wordCount":1520,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"adc-与采样\">ADC 与采样</h1><p>经过<a href=\"signal-conditioning\">信号调理</a>放大滤波后的模拟电压，最终要变成处理器能运算的数字。模数转换（ADC）是这道门槛，而它远不止「读个电压」那么简单：采样定理决定了你必须采多快才不丢信息，量化决定了你能分辨多细，不同的转换架构在速度、精度、功耗之间做着截然不同的取舍。选错采样率会引入无法挽回的混叠失真，选错架构会让 16 位标称分辨率只剩 12 位有效。这一篇把采样与量化的理论，落到 SAR、Δ-Σ、流水线三大主流架构的工程选择上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>ADC 的工作分两步：<strong>采样</strong>（在离散时刻抓取模拟值，时间离散化）与<strong>量化</strong>（把连续幅值映射到有限个码字，幅值离散化）。两步各自有自己的误差来源与设计约束。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[模拟输入] --&gt; AA[抗混叠滤波&lt;br/&gt;限带 &lt; fs/2]&#10;  AA --&gt; SH[采样保持&lt;br/&gt;时间离散化]&#10;  SH --&gt; Q[量化&lt;br/&gt;幅值离散化 N bit]&#10;  Q --&gt; ARCH{架构选择}&#10;  ARCH --&gt;|高速中精度| SAR[SAR 逐次逼近]&#10;  ARCH --&gt;|低速高精度| DS[Δ-Σ 过采样]&#10;  ARCH --&gt;|超高速| PIPE[流水线 Pipeline]&#10;  SAR --&gt; D[数字码]&#10;  DS --&gt; D&#10;  PIPE --&gt; D\">flowchart TD\n  A[模拟输入] --&gt; AA[抗混叠滤波&lt;br/&gt;限带 &lt; fs/2]\n  AA --&gt; SH[采样保持&lt;br/&gt;时间离散化]\n  SH --&gt; Q[量化&lt;br/&gt;幅值离散化 N bit]\n  Q --&gt; ARCH{架构选择}\n  ARCH --&gt;|高速中精度| SAR[SAR 逐次逼近]\n  ARCH --&gt;|低速高精度| DS[Δ-Σ 过采样]\n  ARCH --&gt;|超高速| PIPE[流水线 Pipeline]\n  SAR --&gt; D[数字码]\n  DS --&gt; D\n  PIPE --&gt; D</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>决定什么</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>采样率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>每秒采样次数</td>\n<td>可无失真重建的最高信号频率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>奈奎斯特频率</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_s/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>混叠的分界线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>量化台阶 LSB</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>FS</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>N</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_\\text{FS}/2^N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0913em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">FS</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>幅值分辨率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ENOB</td>\n<td>有效位数</td>\n<td>算上噪声后的真实精度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"采样定理-为什么-fs-必须大于两倍带宽\">采样定理：为什么 fs 必须大于两倍带宽</h2><p>奈奎斯特-香农采样定理是整个数字采集的地基：要无失真地从采样序列重建一个带宽为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 的信号，采样率必须满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_s &gt; 2B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>若违反，高于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_s/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span></span> 的频率成分会被「折叠」到基带，叠加在真实信号上形成<strong>混叠（aliasing）</strong>——一旦混入便无法在数字域分离，因为它们与真实低频成分完全无法区分。这就是<a href=\"signal-conditioning\">信号调理</a>末端必须放抗混叠滤波器的硬性理由：在采样前就把带外能量物理地压下去。</p>\n<p>工程上从不只采到刚好 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>。一是因为理想砖墙滤波器不存在，要留过渡带；二是<strong>过采样</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>≫</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_s \\gg 2B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>）能把量化噪声功率摊到更宽的频带，采样后再数字滤波抽取，可换来额外有效位——每 4 倍过采样约提升 1 位有效分辨率。这正是 Δ-Σ 架构的核心思想。</p>\n<h2 id=\"量化误差与有效位数\">量化误差与有效位数</h2><p>量化把连续幅值四舍五入到最近的码字，误差最大半个 LSB。把这个误差当作均匀分布的白噪声，可推出理想 N 位 ADC 的信噪比</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>SNR</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>6.02</mn><mi>N</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1.76</mn><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{SNR} = 6.02N + 1.76\\ (\\mathrm{dB})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SNR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6.02</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.76</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">dB</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>即每增加一位，信噪比提升约 6 dB。但这只是理论上限。真实 ADC 还有热噪声、采样时钟抖动、积分/微分非线性（INL/DNL）、基准噪声。把所有噪声与失真折算回去，得到<strong>有效位数（ENOB）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>ENOB</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>SINAD</mtext><mo>−</mo><mn>1.76</mn></mrow><mn>6.02</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{ENOB} = \\frac{\\text{SINAD} - 1.76}{6.02}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ENOB</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">6.02</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SINAD</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.76</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>ENOB 才是选型时该看的数字——一颗标称 16 位但 ENOB 只有 12.5 的 ADC，后四位是噪声。时钟抖动对高频输入尤其致命：抖动引入的误差正比于输入频率，所以高速采集对时钟纯净度的要求远超低速。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三大架构的工程取舍\">三大架构的工程取舍</h2><p>主流 ADC 架构在速度-精度-功耗三角里各占一角，理解它们的工作方式就能快速选型。</p>\n<p><strong>SAR（逐次逼近）</strong> 用一个 DAC 和比较器做二分搜索，每个时钟周期定一位，N 位需 N 个周期。它中等速度（kSPS 到数十 MSPS）、中高精度（8-18 位）、功耗与采样率近线性、无延迟，是数据采集与多路传感器扫描的万金油。</p>\n<p><strong>Δ-Σ（过采样）</strong> 用极高过采样率加噪声整形，把量化噪声推到高频再数字滤除，换来 16-24 位的高分辨率，但输出有延迟、速率低（适合直流到数十 kHz）。它是温度、称重、电力计量等高精度低速场景的首选；如前篇所述，现代趋势是把斩波放大前端与 Δ-Σ 集成在一颗模拟前端里（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/1910.14180\">来源</a>）。</p>\n<p><strong>流水线（Pipeline）</strong> 把转换拆成多级、每级并行处理不同样本，实现极高吞吐（数十到数百 MSPS）、中等精度（10-14 位），是高速通信与<a href=\"../sensing/photo-imaging-sensing\">图像传感</a>读出的主力。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>架构</th>\n<th>速度</th>\n<th>精度</th>\n<th>功耗</th>\n<th>延迟</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SAR</td>\n<td>中（≤数十 MSPS）</td>\n<td>8-18 位</td>\n<td>与速率成正比</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>通用采集、多路扫描</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Δ-Σ</td>\n<td>低（≤数十 kHz）</td>\n<td>16-24 位</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>温度、称重、计量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>流水线</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>10-14 位</td>\n<td>较高</td>\n<td>多级流水</td>\n<td>通信、图像、雷达</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"多通道与系统集成\">多通道与系统集成</h2><p>真实系统很少只采一路。多路传感器有两种接法：<strong>多路复用 + 单 ADC</strong>（一颗 SAR 配模拟开关轮询，成本低但各通道非同时采样，相位有偏差）；<strong>每通道独立 ADC</strong>（同步采样，适合相位敏感的振动、电力三相测量）。同步性要求高时优先后者，或选内置采样保持同步触发的多通道器件。</p>\n<p>今天大量传感器把 ADC 直接集成在芯片内，对外只走数字<a href=\"sensor-interfaces-buses\">接口与总线</a>——这把模拟设计的复杂度封进芯片，但也意味着你失去了对调理与采样细节的控制，选型时要回到 <a href=\"../sensing/sensor-classification\">ENOB、噪声密度与积分非线性</a>等数据手册指标去比较。边缘侧还出现把 ADC、处理与 AI 推理合一的智能传感器，相关系统级整合见<a href=\"../systems/iot-smart-sensing\">物联网与智能传感</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>ADC 分采样（时间离散）与量化（幅值离散），各有独立误差来源。</li>\n<li>采样定理要求 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_s &gt; 2B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>，否则混叠无法补救；故采样前必须抗混叠滤波，工程上还用过采样换有效位。</li>\n<li>理想信噪比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6.02</mn><mi>N</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1.76</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6.02N+1.76</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6.02</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.76</span></span></span></span></span> dB，但真正该看 ENOB；时钟抖动对高频输入尤其致命。</li>\n<li>三大架构各占一角：SAR（通用中速）、Δ-Σ（低速高精度，整合斩波前端）、流水线（超高速）。</li>\n<li>多通道按是否需同步采样在「多路复用单 ADC」与「每通道独立 ADC」间选择；集成型器件经<a href=\"sensor-interfaces-buses\">接口与总线</a>直出数字。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"ADC 与采样","id":"adc-与采样"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"采样定理：为什么 fs 必须大于两倍带宽","id":"采样定理-为什么-fs-必须大于两倍带宽"},{"level":2,"text":"量化误差与有效位数","id":"量化误差与有效位数"},{"level":2,"text":"三大架构的工程取舍","id":"三大架构的工程取舍"},{"level":2,"text":"多通道与系统集成","id":"多通道与系统集成"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"信号调理电路","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/sensors-actuators/interface/signal-conditioning"},"next":{"title":"传感器接口与总线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/sensors-actuators/interface/sensor-interfaces-buses"}}